I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, which has no file-system or HTTP interface. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need authority the node doesn't hold. To get either, the graph would have to grant a capability (such as `http-client`), and that change belongs in the node's `with` clause, not in the body.

